# Backend evidence — interactive skill-activation ("ask") flow + skills management HTTP surface (ADR 0021)

Scope: `crates/kernel-core`, `crates/skills`, `crates/api`, `crates/daemon`,
`crates/storage`, `crates/a2a` (one `RunStatus` match-arm fix). Covers both
Parts 0-4 of the design doc (the ask/decide flow) and the mid-flight Part 6
addendum (skills CRUD + runtime-mutable policy over HTTP) — the addendum was
assigned to this same agent specifically to avoid two agents racing edits on
`crates/skills/src/gate.rs`.

## Build / lint / test — bottom line

```
