$ cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings
cargo clippy: No issues found
$ cargo build -p daemon
cargo build (4 crates compiled)
Finished `dev` profile [unoptimized + debuginfo] target(s) in 17.13s
$ cargo test --workspace
...
test result: ok. (41 suites; 172 tests total, 0 failed, 0 ignored)
```

**Before this change: 157 passing tests workspace-wide (confirmed by
running the pre-existing suite unmodified). After: 172 (+15).** Breakdown of
the 15 new tests:
- 8 in `crates/skills/tests/ask_activation_test.rs` (the ask/decide flow,
